 "insight": [
  "Luxembourg's top 10 export chapters in 2025 accounted for a total export value of 16.25 billion euros.",
  "The largest export chapter was Machinery and mechanical appliances, making up 12.5% of exports with 2.04 billion euros.",
  "The top three export chapters together represented 31.8% of total exports, including Plastics and articles thereof at 9.7% and Vehicles and parts at 9.6%.",
  "Other export chapters combined accounted for 31.1% of exports, while confidential exports made up 0.6%.",
  "The values are nominal and not adjusted for price changes, and 1.8% of the export value is confidential at full product detail."
 ],
